p by their movements.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the camera cuts to a dynamic low-angle shot as the white-robed cultivator executes a powerful sidekick, sending the dark-robed fighter flying backward. The dark-robed cultivator tumbles through the air, crashing into a massive boulder behind him with a loud impact, stone fragments scattering. The camera follows the trajectory, emphasizing the force of the kick and the collision.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.000, the camera shifts to a close-up of the dark-robed cultivator slumped against the boulder, blood trickling from the corner of his mouth. His breathing is ragged, eyes narrowed in pain, as he clutches his chest. The white-robed fighter stands a few meters away, sword raised, slowly advancing toward his fallen opponent.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:05.500, the camera cuts to a medium shot as the white-robed cultivator charges forward with a determined yell, sword glowing brighter with white energy. He swings downward in a powerful arc, aiming to end the fight. The dark-robed cultivator, seeing the attack, forces himself to his feet with surprising speed.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:06.500, the camera captures the dark-robed cultivator's desperate move: he plants both red blades into the rocky ground, their crimson energy spreading outward in a circular pattern. A glowing red magic circle forms beneath them, and a shockwave of red energy erupts, knocking the white-robed cultivator backward. The white-robed fighter stumbles, sword dropping from his hand, as the red energy dissipates, leaving him dazed on the ground.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:08.000, the camera follows the white-robed cultivator being launched into the air by the red shockwave, his body twisting as he flies backward. The dark-robed cultivator stands panting, blood still on his lips, watching his opponent soar through the air.\n\n[Shot 7] At 00:09.500, the camera captures the white-robed cultivator at the peak of his arc, suspended in mid-air, sword falling from his grasp. The dark-robed cultivator maintains his stance, the red magic circle still glowing faintly at his feet, as the shot ends.\n\noverall_soundscape: \nThe duel is punctuated by sharp clangs of steel, the whoosh of energy trails, and the thud of boots on stone. The kick and impact against the boulder produce a deep, resonant boom. The magic circle's activation adds a low, humming energy hum, followed by a sharp crack as the red shockwave erupts. The white-robed cultivator's launch is accompanied by a dramatic whoosh of air.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: \nA tense, orchestral score builds during the duel, intensifying with each strike. It peaks during the kick and impact, then drops to a dramatic low as the dark-robed cultivator prepares his counter. The magic circle's activation triggers a sudden, powerful swell of strings and percussion, ending with a dissonant chord as the white-robed fighter is knocked back and launched into the air."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#f5ff14", "size": [505.2900695800781, 608.8582763671875], "pos": [-551.6446533203125, 5532.0302734375], "id": 239, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [427], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["\n\nFor the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: \n[Shot 1] 3D CG, cinematic, a medium-wide shot captures the intense duel between the two cultivators shown in <Picture 1) — the white-robed fighter wielding a single longsword with white energy effects, the dark-robed fighter brandishing two red-glowing blades. They exchange rapid strikes: the white-robed fighter slashes horizontally, leaving a trail of white light; the dark-robed fighter